[2026-07-26] Day 21 (v2.5.0): Usage analytics package — cost breakdowns, trend detection, anomaly detection

New package: usage/
- Tracker aggregates usage records by provider/model with configurable time windows
- Report provides cost breakdown, top-N models, per-provider aggregation
- DetectTrend uses linear regression to identify increasing/decreasing cost patterns
- DetectAnomalies uses z-score to flag unusual cost spikes
- SuggestOptimizations generates actionable cost-saving recommendations (high cost, high input tokens, high latency, low utilization)
- EstimateCost helper for model pricing calculations
- 22 tests and 5 benchmarks (1.2μs Record, 112μs Report@1000 records)
- Example program demonstrating full analytics workflow

